  "title": "39.00",
  "content": "[[File:3900.png|right]] \n39.00\n\n==The Long Prayer==\n\nRegion: the Grey Mountains\n\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">Connects to:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-bidi-font-family: \"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\"> 14.02,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">31.27, 33.00 and </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family: \"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";color:black; mso-themecolor:text1\">33.01.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\"> </span></p>\n\n==Overview==\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">The priests of this shrine to the Speaker of Bronze </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">(33.01) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">believe that their patron can be returned to life if dwarves keep faith in him-her. They pray in shifts, so that every second for the last 999 years prayers to the titan have rung out.</span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">Recently, priests have spoken in tongues. One has prophesized that the Speaker to Bronze will be reborn as a dwarf-child to parents who have never touched iron. </span></p>\n\n==Connections==\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">-Such a dwarf-child is more likely to be born among the iron-poor dwarves of the Burning Lands (31.27) than elsewhere.</span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">-But perhaps that dwarf has already been born to the west of here (14.02). </span></p>\n\n==Hooks==\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">-What does the Hoard </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-bidi-font-family: \"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">(33.00) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">think of the shrine? </span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">-What do the priests of the Drinker of Iron think of the shrine?</span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">-If the Speaker to Bronze returns to life, what will happen to the silver that has been mined from her bones? </span></p>\n[[Category:Hex]]\n[[Category:The Grey Mountains]]",
